        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without this permission, macOS asks separately for each folder (Desktop, Documents, Downloads …). Click “Open System Settings” and turn on Shelf there – if it's missing from the list, add it with “+” or drag it in from the Finder."
